<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>شخص | شجره‌نامه قباکلکی</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f0e6;
      color: #173f2b;
    }

    header {
      background: #174d36;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #e7f0e8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 94%;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 25px auto 50px;
    }

    .profile {
      background: #fffdf8;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 7px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .photo {
      width: 105px;
      height: 105px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e3eadf;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 15px;
      font-size: 42px;
    }

    .profile h2 {
      margin: 5px 0 8px;
      color: #174d36;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #68766d;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .details {
      text-align: right;
      background: #f6f7f1;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 15px;
    }

    .detail {
      padding: 10px 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dde3d9;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .detail:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .label {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #286747;
    }

    .section {
      background: #fffdf8;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 7px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section h3 {
      margin: 0 0 17px;
      color: #174d36;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .person-card {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #173f2b;
      background: #f7f8f3;
      border: 1px solid #e0e5dc;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      transition: .2s;
    }

    .person-card:hover {
      background: #eef4ed;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .person-card strong {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .person-card small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: #718076;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .spouse-box {
      background: #f5eee0;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .spouse-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #76552c;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .not-found {
      background: #fffdf8;
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 7px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    }

    .not-found .icon {
      font-size: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .not-found h2 {
      color: #174d36;
    }

    .not-found a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      background: #286747;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .empty {
      color: #788279;
      background: #f7f7f3;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #718076;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>🌳 شجره‌نامه خاندان غلامحسین قاسم زائر غلامحسین</h1>
  <a class="back" href="members.html">← بازگشت به شجره‌نامه</a>
</header>

<div class="container" id="app"></div>

<footer>
  شجره‌نامه قباکلکی
</footer>


